        // consecutive pair `(ALL[i], ALL[i+1])` satisfies
        // `ALL[i].precedes(ALL[i+1])` because `index_of(ALL[i]) == i
        // < i + 1 == index_of(ALL[i+1])` (and symmetrically on the
