        // `T::CARDINALITY` past the (min == 0, every-count == 0)
        // degenerate arm where every variant satisfies the vacuous
        // `0 == 0` predicate — the empty-slice guard maps `&[]` to `0`
        // before the sweep. Sibling posture to
        // `count_modal_variants_returns_zero_on_the_empty_slice_across_every_kind`
        // one DIRECTION axis over: both direction-anchor cardinality-
        // count corners collapse to `0` at the empty-slice endpoint;
        // sibling posture to
