        // `T::is_unique_antimodal_variant_of(v, &[v])` is `false` for
        // every variant `v` — the sole position hits `v` with count `1`,
        // every non-target variant has count `0`, T::min_variant_count
        // collapses to `0`, T::is_antimodal_variant_of(v, [v]) is `false`
        // at count == 1 != min == 0, and the conjunction lands on `false`
        // through the membership arm. LOAD-BEARING ASYMMETRY against
        // T::is_unique_modal_variant_of which returns `true` on the same
