        // T::min_variant_count == 1 on the flat-histogram fixpoint,
        // every variant sits at BOTH extremes via the (max == min ==
        // 1) collapse, and NO variant satisfies the strict interior
        // conjunction. The LOAD-BEARING flat-histogram None-arm
