        // T::has_unique_repeating_variant reports `true` via
        // count_repeating_variants == 1, and the conjunction lands on
        // `true` at T::ALL[0] and `false` at every other target.
        // LOAD-BEARING DISCRIMINATOR from
        // is_unique_middle_band_variant_of which reports `true` at
